 },
 {
  "id": "sce435:00067",
  "jp": "ヤマト「まぁ、下手に説明するよりは知らニャいところで{nl}　落ちて壊れたってことにするほうがカドがたたニャいと{nl}　思うけど‥‥」",
  "off": 103,
  "len": 75,
  "en": "Yamato: Well, rather than explaining it clumsily, I think it'll ruffle fewer feathers to just say it fell and broke when nyobody was around...",
